    "detailed_description": "<u><strong>ATTENTION: PHOTOSSENSITIVITY WARNING</strong></u><br><br>This game contains visual effects that may trigger seizures in individuals susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy. If you, or someone in your family, has a history of epilepsy, consult a doctor before playing.<br><br><strong>Description: </strong><br>When two witches and an apprentice are kidnapped in a mansion, only Star, the apprentice, can save them and uncover what is happening.<br><br>The veil that separates order and chaos is weakened. Days ago, the witches' council detected the misuse of chaotic energy, determined to maintain the world's order, they send two of their best witches and an apprentice to investigate what may be happening.<br><br><strong>Gameplay: </strong><br>Explore the mansion in search of your friends. The main character, Star, has no eyes but can see through sound. Use this mechanic to uncover secrets, keys. But beware, because you are not alone. There is something else trying to break the veil that separates the realms to cross over to our side. Don't let him catch you, hide, because he roams through the mansion.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover what is happening through files:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830010/extras/77a886548495c44905926f60441539b5.poster.avif?t=1714582148\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830010/extras/77a886548495c44905926f60441539b5.webm?t=1714582148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830010/extras/77a886548495c44905926f60441539b5.mp4?t=1714582148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve Puzzles:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830010/extras/1e78ea808a0faa59f5c325c86df481b1.poster.avif?t=1714582148\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830010/extras/1e78ea808a0faa59f5c325c86df481b1.webm?t=1714582148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830010/extras/1e78ea808a0faa59f5c325c86df481b1.mp4?t=1714582148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And Save Your Friends:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830010/extras/d3a92f64bcebad8397d1e49401d18109.poster.avif?t=1714582148\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830010/extras/d3a92f64bcebad8397d1e49401d18109.webm?t=1714582148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830010/extras/d3a92f64bcebad8397d1e49401d18109.mp4?t=1714582148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the World of Witch Veil.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830010/extras/7e60a1cfc8fd1452f6fc7bfd46e7ac89.poster.avif?t=1714582148\" width=320 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830010/extras/7e60a1cfc8fd1452f6fc7bfd46e7ac89.webm?t=1714582148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
